      "text": " Leader-based — writes go through a leader; followers replicate the leader's log\nNo conflict on write.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " Leader-based — writes go through a leader; followers replicate the leader's log\nNo conflict on write.",
