      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788643495383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Failure        Symptom        Detection        Mitigation",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Failure        Symptom        Detection        Mitigation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c39p0sRHwBqvKk7S9O-aF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 522.8779337291581,
      "y": 6171.185732309651,
      "width": 715.2988891601562,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 904924725,
      "version": 40,
      "versionNonce": 1013967989,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788643495383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Single node failure        Preference-list write/read misses one replica        Gossip\nmarks node suspect (Phi Accrual)        Sloppy quorum + hinted handoff keeps\nwrites flowing; reads still satisfy R from remaining healthy replicas",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Single node failure        Preference-list write/read misses one replica        Gossip marks node suspect (Phi Accrual)        Sloppy quorum + hinted handoff keeps writes flowing; reads still satisfy R from remaining healthy replicas",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "iEbQf6ypcn-uvPrLAr-ru",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 504.50793861197064,
      "y": 6243.685732309651,
      "width": 752.0388793945312,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1804000155,
      "version": 40,
      "versionNonce": 1948975451,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788643495383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Network partition        Cluster splits into two groups, each thinks the other is down\nGossip convergence stalls across the partition        Each side keeps accepting writes\n(AP choice) → conflicting versions accumulate → reconciled via vector clocks +\nanti-entropy once partition heals",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Network partition        Cluster splits into two groups, each thinks the other is down        Gossip convergence stalls across the partition        Each side keeps accepting writes (AP choice) → conflicting versions accumulate → reconciled via vector clocks + anti-entropy once partition heals",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "mxXFQ0Nz_UDnbRpqpONSK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 506.15787147329877,
      "y": 6366.185732309651,
      "width": 748.739013671875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 429555605,
      "version": 40,
      "versionNonce": 2030343637,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788643495383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Concurrent writes to same key        Divergent values on different replicas\n(\"siblings\")        Vector clock comparison at read time shows non-descending clocks\nApp-level merge, LWW, or CRDT merge depending on data shape (Section 8)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Concurrent writes to same key        Divergent values on different replicas (\"siblings\")        Vector clock comparison at read time shows non-descending clocks        App-level merge, LWW, or CRDT merge depending on data shape (Section 8)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Z3mOIWGs_vdTnE7NBXsVo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 503.95792030142377,
      "y": 6438.685732309651,
      "width": 753.138916015625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1123987515,
      "version": 40,
      "versionNonce": 2006457851,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788643495383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Clock skew across nodes        If using LWW: a causally-earlier write \"wins\" because\nits node's clock is ahead        Hard to detect directly; shows up as \"lost\" writes\nreported by users        NTP on all nodes; prefer vector clocks or hybrid logical clocks\nover raw wall-clock LWW for correctness-sensitive data",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Clock skew across nodes        If using LWW: a causally-earlier write \"wins\" because its node's clock is ahead        Hard to detect directly; shows up as \"lost\" writes reported by users        NTP on all nodes; prefer vector clocks or hybrid logical clocks over raw wall-clock LWW for correctness-sensitive data",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "L617JxlQ38FEwnHrwo5MS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 519.5679056529863,
      "y": 6548.685732309651,
      "width": 721.9189453125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1974453493,
      "version": 40,
      "versionNonce": 66917173,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788643495383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hot key / hot partition        One key (celebrity item, viral post) receives\ndisproportionate traffic, overloading its 3 replica nodes        Per-key/per-node\nthroughput metrics spike        Cache the hot key in front of the store; for writable\nhot keys, consider key-splitting (key#0..key#9) with client-side fan-in on read",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hot key / hot partition        One key (celebrity item, viral post) receives disproportionate traffic, overloading its 3 replica nodes        Per-key/per-node throughput metrics spike        Cache the hot key in front of the store; for writable hot keys, consider key-splitting (key#0..key#9) with client-side fan-in on read",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "IhA7O38X5EnO39TGXIxiX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 527.9579203014238,
      "y": 6671.185732309651,
      "width": 705.138916015625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1372778715,
