      "updated": 1788643495383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Compaction falling behind        Read amplification rises (many SSTables to check\nper read); read latency climbs        SSTable count per node / read latency\npercentiles        Throttle foreground write rate, prioritize compaction I/O, add nodes\nto reduce per-node write pressure",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
