      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788643495383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cascading failure from client retries        A slow/struggling node gets hammered by\nretrying clients, worsening its overload        Error rate + latency spike correlated\nwith retry volume        Client-side circuit breaker + exponential backoff with jitter\n(see the Circuit Breaker guide)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Cascading failure from client retries        A slow/struggling node gets hammered by retrying clients, worsening its overload        Error rate + latency spike correlated with retry volume        Client-side circuit breaker + exponential backoff with jitter (see the Circuit Breaker guide)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "nWmaiCzI_ECz8lRvGUYvD",
      "type": "text",
