      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Merkle tree sync overload        Anti-entropy competes with foreground traffic,\ndegrading latency        p99 latency spikes during scheduled sync windows\nRate-limit anti-entropy bandwidth/CPU; schedule during low-traffic windows;\nprioritize by staleness",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Merkle tree sync overload        Anti-entropy competes with foreground traffic, degrading latency        p99 latency spikes during scheduled sync windows        Rate-limit anti-entropy bandwidth/CPU; schedule during low-traffic windows; prioritize by staleness",
